    "Add Link…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加链接…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cookie 中缺少 BDUSS，无法登录。请在浏览器登录 pan.baidu.com，在开发者工具的“网络”面板中复制网盘主页第一条请求的 Cookie 请求头。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BDUSS is missing from the Cookie, so you can’t log in. Log in to pan.baidu.com in your browser, and copy the Cookie request header of the first request to the netdisk home page from the “Network” panel of the developer tools."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cookie 中缺少 STOKEN，无法转存。请在浏览器登录 pan.baidu.com，在开发者工具的“网络”面板中复制网盘主页第一条请求的 Cookie 请求头。passport.baidu.com 的 STOKEN 不能用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "STOKEN is missing from the Cookie, so files can’t be transferred. Log in to pan.baidu.com in your browser, and copy the Cookie request header of the first request to the netdisk home page from the “Network” panel of the developer tools. The STOKEN of passport.baidu.com doesn’t work."
          }
        }
      }
    },
