    "只有超级会员可以同时使用多个连接。其他账号会被百度限速，限速可能持续数小时到数天，并影响这个账号的所有客户端。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only SVIP accounts can use multiple connections. Other accounts are throttled by Baidu for hours to days, affecting all clients of that account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
