    "在浏览器中登录 pan.baidu.com，打开开发者工具的“网络”面板并刷新页面，选中第一条请求，复制请求头中 Cookie 的值。Cookie 需要包含 BDUSS 和 STOKEN。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Log in to pan.baidu.com in your browser, open the “Network” panel of the developer tools and refresh the page, select the first request, and copy the value of its Cookie request header. The Cookie must contain BDUSS and STOKEN."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复制分享链接后切换到 Ferry，自动打开“添加链接”并填入链接和提取码。": {
